  st: ["FSH recruits a wave of follicles.", "A dominant follicle develops and makes oestrogen.", "Oestrogen causes oestrus behaviour.", "Oestrogen triggers the LH surge.", "Ovulation occurs and the corpus luteum forms.", "If not pregnant, uterine PGF2 alpha causes luteolysis."],
