  ex: ["A dairy herd with drooling, vesicles on tongue and lameness: FMD.", "Ducklings dying with haemorrhagic liver: DHAV.", "A cat shelter with oral ulcers and sneezing: feline calicivirus."],
  k: ["Seven serotypes.", "Pigs as amplifiers.", "NADCP.", "FCV features.", "EEE, WEE, VEE."],
  m: ["FMDV is acid labile. NSP antibody indicates infection, not vaccination. India is free of EEE and WEE. Type C is probably extinct."],
  sa: [["How many serotypes does FMDV have?", "Seven: O, A, C, Asia 1, SAT 1, SAT 2 and SAT 3."], ["What is the DIVA test for FMD?", "NSP 3ABC antibody ELISA."], ["Which virus causes the limping syndrome in cats?", "Feline calicivirus."]],
  la: [["Describe foot-and-mouth disease: aetiology, epidemiology, signs, diagnosis and control.", "Virus, serotypes, hosts, signs, tests, vaccine, programme."], ["Write notes on feline calicivirus, duck viral hepatitis and equine encephalomyelitis viruses.", "Properties, hosts, signs, control."]],
