  ex: ["A cattle herd with firm nodules all over the skin after monsoon: LSD.", "Lambs with scabby lips: orf.", "Pigs with rapid deaths and enlarged dark spleens in the Northeast: suspect ASF."],
  k: ["Brick-shaped virion.", "Capripox genus.", "Orf zoonosis.", "Fowl pox forms.", "ASF features."],
  m: ["ASF has no vaccine in India. LSD is not a zoonosis. Orf is zoonotic. Fowl pox is spread by mosquitoes and contact."],
  sa: [["What is the causal agent of lumpy skin disease?", "Lumpy skin disease virus, a Capripoxvirus."], ["Which inclusion body is typical of fowl pox?", "Bollinger body."], ["How does ASFV spread?", "Contact, contaminated pork products, fomites and Ornithodoros ticks."]],
