  m: ["Never wash gunshot wounds. Do not preserve toxicology samples in formalin. Ante-mortem wounds show vital reaction."],
  sa: [["What is a veterolegal case?", "A case that may result in legal action, such as poisoning, cruelty or insurance claims."], ["How do you tell an ante-mortem wound from a post-mortem wound?", "Ante-mortem wounds show haemorrhage, swelling and inflammation; post-mortem wounds do not."], ["What is chain of custody?", "A written record of everyone who handled the evidence."]],
