  ex: ["A cow with grape-like nodules on the pleura: bovine TB.", "A cow with chronic watery diarrhoea and corrugated ileum: Johne's.", "A bullock with hard tongue: actinobacillosis."],
  k: ["TB lesion.", "Johne's gross.", "Lumpy jaw.", "Wooden tongue.", "Granuloma types."],
  m: ["Bird TB has no calcification. Johne's has no fever. Actinomycosis is bone; actinobacillosis is soft tissue."],
  sa: [["What is a tubercle?", "A granuloma with caseous necrosis surrounded by epithelioid cells, giant cells and a capsule."], ["What is the gross lesion of Johne's?", "Thick corrugated ileal mucosa with enlarged lymph nodes and beaded lymphatics."], ["How do actinomycosis and actinobacillosis differ?", "Bone and Gram-positive versus soft tissue and Gram-negative."]],
  la: [["Describe the pathology of bovine tuberculosis.", "Pathogenesis, lesions, microscopy, spread, diagnosis."], ["Describe the lesions of Johne's disease.", "Gross, microscopic, forms, diagnosis."]],
