  ex: ["Dogs with convulsions after a bait: strychnine suspicion.", "A cow with chocolate-brown blood after sorghum: nitrite.", "A sheep with black kidneys and jaundice: copper."],
  k: ["Heavy metals.", "Pesticides.", "Nitrate and cyanide.", "Fluoride.", "Bracken and Lantana."],
  m: ["Cyanide blood is bright; nitrite blood is brown. Never preserve toxicology samples in formalin. Treat with a veterinarian: this app gives no doses."],
  sa: [["What is the lesion of chronic copper poisoning in sheep?", "Gunmetal kidneys, jaundice, enlarged liver and haemoglobinuria after a haemolytic crisis."], ["What colours differentiate nitrite and cyanide poisoning?", "Nitrite chocolate-brown blood; cyanide cherry-red blood."], ["How does bracken poison cattle?", "Marrow aplasia with haemorrhages, and carcinogenic bladder tumours in chronic exposure."]],
