  sa: [["What is flushing?", "Extra feeding before and during breeding to increase ovulation and twins."], ["Name two milch goat breeds.", "Jamunapari and Beetal."], ["What is creep feeding?", "Feeding suckling young a special diet that adults cannot reach."]],
  la: [["Describe the breeds of sheep and goats of India with their economic traits.", "Wool, mutton, milk, fibre breeds; traits."], ["Describe the management of sheep and goats at breeding, lambing, weaning and fattening.", "Ram and buck schedule, flushing, lambing care, weaning, fattening."]],
