  la: [["Describe Caesarean section in the cow: indications, approach, technique and aftercare.", "Indications, left flank, steps, closure, care, prognosis."], ["Describe obstetrical anaesthesia and maternal obstetrical paralysis.", "Epidural, local and general anaesthesia principles; cause, diagnosis and nursing of paralysis."]],
