  k: ["Regenerative versus non-regenerative.", "Causes of haemolysis.", "DIC.", "Bovine leukosis.", "Lymph node filters."],
  m: ["No calculation. Reference ranges differ by species."],
  sa: [["Differentiate regenerative and non-regenerative anaemia.", "Regenerative shows increased young red cells from a marrow response; non-regenerative lacks the response."], ["What is DIC?", "A consumptive clotting disorder with widespread clots and bleeding."], ["Name haemoparasites that cause anaemia.", "Babesia, Theileria, Anaplasma and Trypanosoma."]],
